    📊 TRANSMISSION VARIABLES (trend drivers)
      10Y yield and DXY are not "events" — they are continuous structure. They determine whether setups like SMC, FVG, or BOS are valid or fragile.
      💡 Monitor continuously. Rising DXY + rising yields = crypto headwind regardless of on-chain signals.

    🔄 CONTINUOUS SENTIMENT / POSITIONING (filters)
      VIX, FedWatch, funding rates. Not news events — positioning pressure gauges.
      💡 Use as filters, not triggers. VIX >20 = caution, >30 = panic.

